Copy this file to `docs/testflight.local.md` (gitignored) and fill in your own account's values.
Never commit the real one.

## App Store Connect API key

- Key ID: `<from App Store Connect ▸ Users and Access ▸ Keys>`
- Issuer ID: `<same page>`
- Key file: `~/.appstoreconnect/private_keys/AuthKey_<key id>.p8` (not in this repo)
- Team: `<your Apple Developer team id>`

## ASC entity IDs (stable once created)

- Bundle ID entity: `<id>` (`app.todo2ink.reminders`)
- Distribution certificate: `<id>`
- Provisioning profile: `<id>` ("Todo2Ink AppStore", uuid `<uuid>`)

## Regenerating the provisioning profile

If a capability change ever invalidates it, delete the old one and recreate:

```python
api('DELETE', 'profiles/<profile id>')
resp = api('POST', 'profiles', {'data': {'type': 'profiles', 'attributes': {
    'name': 'Todo2Ink AppStore', 'profileType': 'IOS_APP_STORE'
}, 'relationships': {
    'bundleId': {'data': {'type': 'bundleIds', 'id': '<bundle id entity>'}},
    'certificates': {'data': [{'type': 'certificates', 'id': '<certificate id>'}]},
    'devices': {'data': []}
}}})
# then write resp['data']['attributes']['profileContent'] (base64) to both
#   ~/Library/Developer/Xcode/UserData/Provisioning Profiles/<uuid>.mobileprovision
#   ~/Library/MobileDevice/Provisioning Profiles/<uuid>.mobileprovision
```
